{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55672","headline":"偈 一 · 延寿","name":"偈 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤猿叫落中岩月，野客吟残半夜灯。\n此境此时谁得意？白云深处坐禅僧。\n（《五灯会元》卷十。\n）（按：张靖龙云：见清严行恂《康熙雪窦寺志》卷三「中峯庵」条，题作《夜坐诗》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}